<title>USA: National-Standard to buy back 100,000 more shares.</title>
<headline>National-Standard to buy back 100,000 more shares.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Mich. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>National-Standard Co said Thursday its board of directors approved the repurchase of an additional 100,000 common shares on top of the 25,000 approved for repurchase in February.</p>
<p>The company said the recent $11 price for its stock presents an opportunity to buy back shares at a good value. National-Standard added it has acquired more than 88,000 shgares over the last 12 months using internal funds.</p>
<p>National-Standard makes wire and wire-related products.</p>
<p>Its stock was unchanged Thursday afternoon at 6-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
